You are free to share and adapt them, for any purpose, including
commercially, on two conditions:

  BY   Attribution. Give appropriate credit, link to the licence, and say if
       you changed anything.
  SA   ShareAlike. If you remix or build on them, distribute your version
       under this same licence.

This is deliberately different from the licence on the code. The plugin is
MIT (see ../LICENSE); the questions are writing, and ShareAlike keeps any
bank derived from this one as open as this one is.

Installing the plugin copies these files into your vault. Your ANSWERS are
yours: nothing in this licence reaches them, and the plugin never sends them
anywhere you have not configured.
